ok: EVAL before HELLO is refused
ok: HELLO answers the epoch and a slot range
ok: a signed fragment runs: its result comes back
ok: its println is captured, not printed by the node
ok: the same line again: replay
ok: signed by another key: bad_signature
ok: a cap the policy does not list: policy
ok: listed in the policy: allowed
ok: a panicking fragment answers PANIC with its message
ok: with the output it printed first
ok: a fragment that never returns is cancelled: TIMEOUT
ok: within the timeout plus a second
ok: the node keeps serving after a panic and a timeout
ok: an entry the fragment does not define: no_entry
ok: an EVAL for another epoch: epoch_changed
ok: an unknown field: bad_args
ok: a fifth concurrent session: busy
ok: each session owns its own slot range
ok: every EVAL is audited, in order
ok: the audit line carries the source
